  "headline": "OECD Assesses Indonesia's Economic Outlook And Potential Risks",
  "seoTitle": "OECD Assesses Indonesia's Economic Outlook",
  "metaDescription": "The OECD evaluates Indonesia's economic stability, noting a solid current performance alongside long-term growth forecasts and potential future risks.",
